\begin{tcolorbox}[
    enhanced,
    colback=accentbg,
    colframe=accentborder,
    boxrule=1.5pt,
    arc=4pt,
    title={\Large\bfseries\sffamily Academic Disclaimer \& Course Context}
]
\sffamily\normalsize\setlength{\parskip}{8pt}

\textbf{1. Pedagogical Objective}\\
This textbook provides a rigorous, human-centered, and systems-engineering treatment of complex problem solving, tailored specifically for computer science and engineering undergraduates facing non-deterministic real-world challenges.

\textbf{2. Academic Rigor}\\
All methodologies, from Stanford d.school frameworks and Double Diamond models to Multi-Criteria Decision Analysis (MCDA) and Service Blueprinting, are presented with both qualitative empathy and analytical rigor.

\textbf{3. Continuous Improvement}\\
Engineering education thrives on feedback. Readers and instructors are encouraged to submit case study expansions and feedback to the academic curriculum cell.
\end{tcolorbox}
